-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Castle Master
  Publisher   Incentive, 1990
  Version     1.2

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Castle Master (1990)(Incentive).tap
  MD5         25850b04407125dfc4cb9a0fd652e71a

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  The game's 3D view is drawn again by a Next renderer on Layer 2, each
  surface in its own colour. The play area has no colour clash to remove. Game
  logic is unchanged.

  Pace        original (+5% measured in NexClash simulator)

  Changes     1.2: starts with DivMMC automap off, as every catalogue patch;
              first version in the NXC catalogue
              1.1: the loading screen shows from ENTER while the game is
              built, with Patching and a dot for each bank, and is no longer
              held 4 seconds

  Note        Not a sprite build: the 3D view is redrawn by a Next renderer on
              Layer 2, each surface in its own colour with the original's
              dither kept, and extra in-between views make movement smoother
              while the game keeps its own pace. The sight, pointer and
              messages are sprites over the view. The original loading screen
              shows from ENTER while the loader builds the game. Original
              colours on the menu gives the game's own two colours with the
              smooth views. Keys as the original.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite strength
   2  Bubble does not move

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

