  Replay      every view of 524 sampled screen updates of one recording equal
              per pixel to a model of the original's renderer; the game's own
              RAM and registers equal at each; all 18 dissolve views (version
              1.1's build: 1.2 differs only in its start-up)

  Emulator    CSpect 4.5.9: version 1.2 default build starts and shows the
              first view

  Coverage    one recording (5,233 updates); neither cheat played

  Hardware    ZX Spectrum Next (owner's): version 1.1 loaded from its patch
